Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 22:11:52 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 26/48] Sync the liveness engine: ONNX Runtime telemetry off

Engine jars from Mosip26 16d5ce9 ("Disable ONNX Runtime telemetry in the
analyzer"): OnnxModels switches ONNX Runtime's own telemetry off on the
shared environment once per process (OrtEnvironment.setTelemetry(false);
any failure is ignored). With the removed TelemetryInitializer provider
(368641e) the engine neither starts nor enables ORT telemetry on Android.

The four jars are rebuilt (new SHA-256 in engine-sync.txt); the model
bundle (pad-2026.10.1) and CameraXFrameSource are unchanged. engine-sync.txt
now names the last commit that changed the engine, not Mosip26 HEAD.

Module tests 73/73.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
